\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. We have heard a joyful sound:
\par Jesus saves!
\par Spread the gladness all around:
\par Jesus saves!
\par Bear the news to every land,
\par Climb the steeps and cross the waves;
\par Onward! 'tis our Lord's command:
\par Jesus saves!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Sing above the battle's strife:
\par Jesus saves!
\par By His death and endless life,
\par Jesus saves!
\par Sing it softly through the gloom,
\par When the heart for mercy craves;
\par Sing in triumph o'er the tomb:
\par Jesus saves!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Give the winds a mighty voice:
\par Jesus saves!
\par Let the nations now rejoice:
\par Jesus saves!
\par Shout salvation full and free
\par To every strand that ocean laves-
\par This our song of victory:
\par Jesus saves!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
